WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.040
I know that finding a good paid traffic agency is not an easy task.

00:04.040 --> 00:08.920
Before working with the agency I'm with today, I had some really bad experiences.

00:08.920 --> 00:14.120
My name is Cintia, I'm the owner of Casa Tropical and Casa Tropical Café here in the interior of São Paulo.

00:14.120 --> 00:19.200
With the agencies I worked with before, it felt like we weren't even speaking the same language.

00:19.200 --> 00:24.920
The feeling I had was that they didn't truly understand my business.

00:24.920 --> 00:29.520
So in the meantime, we ended up running creatives that didn't convert,

00:29.520 --> 00:32.840
spent a lot of money, and it just didn't work out.

00:32.840 --> 00:38.320
It didn't work because no matter how much I tried to explain,

00:38.320 --> 00:42.200
that I work in Premium Fashion and Gastronomy,

00:42.200 --> 00:47.760
they couldn't adapt — the formulas were too rigid,

00:47.760 --> 00:52.360
what worked for one client was copy-pasted for everyone, and that doesn't work.

00:52.360 --> 00:54.520
And at some point, you just get tired of it.

00:54.520 --> 00:59.640
It was during that period that, after going through one agency then another,

00:59.640 --> 01:03.440
I decided to look for an alternative that actually worked for my business.

01:03.440 --> 01:09.640
And here we are — going into our third year with Arthur, and I'm very happy because

01:09.640 --> 01:13.160
during this time, we grew in e-commerce sales,

01:13.160 --> 01:16.480
we grew in the number of customers walking into our physical store,

01:16.480 --> 01:20.920
because we managed to build strategies for both digital and in-person,

01:20.920 --> 01:26.440
our café is in full growth, and today we're a recognized brand online.

01:26.440 --> 01:31.280
So I'm here to reassure you — it works, it's possible.

01:31.280 --> 01:37.400
My recommendation is that you have a conversation with the team,

01:37.400 --> 01:42.320
because for me, it was a turning point. I'm very happy.

01:42.320 --> 01:47.280
Going into our third year — and however many more years ahead, they'll be with me.
